		<item>
			<title>Veronique de Lourdes &amp;#9658; Garth Hi babyface! I hope ur not workin too hard. I have this strange premonition that Madonna might surprise us with an acoustic version of GMAYL? to push its sales back up on the iTunes chart?. I have not posted this theory yet on the forum because I will be ripped to shreds by those savages. I was listening to W.Orbit's interview today and he said that today he is currently working w M across the Atl</title>
			<link>http://drownedmadonna.com/community/24484-garth/profile.html</link>
			<guid>http://drownedmadonna.com/community/24484-garth/profile.html</guid>
			<description><![CDATA[<img src="http://drownedmadonna.com/components/com_community/assets/favicon/default.png" alt="" />&nbsp;<a class="actor-link" href="http://drownedmadonna.com//community/25662-veronique-de-lourdes/profile.html">Veronique de Lourdes</a> &#9658; <a href="http://drownedmadonna.com//community/24484-garth/profile.html">Garth</a> Hi babyface! I hope ur not workin too hard. I have this strange premonition that Madonna might surprise us with an acoustic version of GMAYL? to push its sales back up on the iTunes chart?. I have not posted this theory yet on the forum because I will be ripped to shreds by those savages. I was listening to W.Orbit's interview today and he said that today he is currently working w M across the Atl]]></description>
